96
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:24,410
As expected, I don't feel the memory inheritance down there.

97
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,850
Actually,

98
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:28,410
even if you knew,

99
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:31,610
you will never get past me

100
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:34,050
