121
00:07:20,320 --> 00:07:21,890
From the beginning,

122
00:07:21,640 --> 00:07:23,570
I only wanted to leave this place.

123
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:25,650
Your quarrels have nothing to do with me.

124
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,650
In that case,

125
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:28,170
