128
00:07:32,400 --> 00:07:33,570
My artifact ?

129
00:07:33,960 --> 00:07:35,930
Why can't I sense it !?

130
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,930
It's the Ancient God's restriction,

131
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,930
