137
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,490
Ancient God Tactic,

138
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:06,090
activate !

139
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:20,930
How naive !

140
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:26,490
No one can oppose a god.

141
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:30,890
And now,

142
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:33,330
you will all die here !

143
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:40,010
The power of an Ancient God

144
00:08:39,800 --> 00:08:42,010
