145
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,850
If Tuo Sen obtains the memory inheritance,

146
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:45,250
I will also die for sure.

147
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:47,850
What am I missing ?

148
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:49,570
Actually,

149
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:51,330
even if you knew,

150
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:54,530
you will never get past me

151
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:56,930
to obtain the memory inheritance !

152
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,850
What does this sentence really mean ?

153
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:03,330
Could it be...?

154
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,530
Again ?

155
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:28,090
Core Formation brat,

156
00:09:28,560 --> 00:09:31,290
