159
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:38,130
Is my guess correct ?

160
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:46,730
Mere tricks...

161
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:50,490
I split my Soul into Divine Sense

162
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,850
