163
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:53,610
Transfer !

164
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:59,050
You what ?

165
00:10:59,040 --> 00:11:01,090
Core Formation brat,

166
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:03,930
how dare you compete with me !?

167
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:26,450
NOOOO !!!

168
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:53,450
He's refining an artifact

169
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,770
