172
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:31,890
If such an artifact

173
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:33,930
fell in the hands of any cultivator,

174
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:35,930
they would have unmatched power.

175
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:38,050
In the Ancient God's memories,

176
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:40,650
