177
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:42,130
This is unvaluable...

178
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,530
But the materials

179
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:46,170
really are too extravagant...

180
00:13:46,560 --> 00:13:48,370
Among Ancient Gods,

181
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:53,050
there are no cultivation levels like in the cultivation world.

182
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:55,170
Ancient Gods refine their bodies.

183
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:59,650
Cultivation only involves the Divine Sense and the body.

184
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:01,770
Every Ancient God

185
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:04,690
will use most of the spiritual energy they devour

186
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:06,890
to strengthen their body.

187
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:11,290
When the body reaches the limit of how much spiritual energy it can hold,

188
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:15,050
it will undergo a reconstruction

189
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:17,370
to make the body bigger.

190
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:19,890
This is a process

191
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:21,730
of qualitative change.

192
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:24,490
The more reconstructions there are,

193
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:27,130
the stronger the cultivation.

194
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:30,770
The memory inheritance you absorbed

195
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:33,850
contains the memories of my entire life.

196
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:37,610
I went through 8 reconstructions.

197
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:39,210
And you

198
00:14:39,280 --> 00:14:41,650
by using your Divine Sense as the guide

199
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:43,930
and my memories as the trigger

200
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:46,130
have already gone through it once.

201
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:49,610
I have placed the location

202
00:14:49,560 --> 00:14:53,170
of the Void Ink Stones in your memories.

203
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:55,090
Take them.

204
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,530
How far you can go

205
00:14:58,040 --> 00:15:00,010
in the rest of your journey

206
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:02,650
will depend on yourself.

207
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:24,530
200 years later

208
00:15:57,280 --> 00:15:58,930
I never thought that

209
00:15:58,680 --> 00:16:01,450
I would see myself in this body once again.

210
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:05,770
I have placed the location

211
00:16:06,160 --> 00:16:09,730
of the Void Ink Stones in your memories.

212
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:11,810
Take them.

213
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:55,770
Open !

214
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:02,610
I want your body,

215
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:03,810
dead man.

216
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:05,170
Divine Sense,

217
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:06,290
return !

218
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:07,570
This time,

219
00:17:07,320 --> 00:17:09,210
no one can stop me !

220
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:12,850
Be it his talent or Spirit Root, Ma Liang's body

221
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:15,090
is far superior to my previous body.

222
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,930
Congratulations on your new life.

223
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,650
Underworld Ice Flame,

224
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:38,450
appear !

225
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:00,410
Land of the Ancient God,

226
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:02,090
farewell.

227
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:22,850
Stop torturing me !

228
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:24,490
I'll talk !

229
00:18:24,600 --> 00:18:25,930
I'll talk !

230
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:28,610
Tu Si's memory inheritance

231
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:32,210
will take 1000 years to reform if he doesn't absorb it.

232
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:41,610
1000 years...

233
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:43,490
I will wait !

234
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:45,570
Core Formation brat,

235
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:48,010
the day I leave this place

236
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:50,730
will be the day you die !

237
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:52,770
Even if I

238
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:55,770
have to seach high and low,

239
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:58,370
I will definitely kill you

240
00:18:58,600 --> 00:19:01,170
and leave no trace of your existence !

241
00:19:05,760 --> 00:21:21,870
The scene of Wang Lin tranfering his soul to the memory inheritance was VERY different in the novel. The problem is that they kept the novel's dialogue but not what happens in it. I took the liberty of rewriting Wang Lin's dialogue to fit to what happens in the donghua.

In the novel, Li Peng had a clone that he sacrified to allow Wang Lin to enter the memory inheritance.

“Tuo Sen, anyone but you can inherit Master’s memory inheritance. Little guy, it all depends on your luck!”
Those last words were meant for Wang Lin. In that moment, he made a decision, a decision that would cost him a price he could barely withstand.

Suddenly, the man covered in scales pointed his hand at his brow and said, “Using my clone as a sacrifice, I transfer the memory inheritance!” His clone quickly shook, and along with the spear, both turned into golden specks of light and disappeared. Wang Lin’s soul, which was spreading out quickly, shrunk, as if it were being sucked in by a strong force. In the blink of an eye, Wang Lin’s soul was sucked in by the special scale and disappeared.
-> This is what they made Wang Lin say but it makes no sense in the donghua's context which is why I changed it.

242
00:19:14,380 --> 00:19:18,510
I've had my share of wounds,

243
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:18,510
now I want to fight back.

244
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:22,070
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

245
00:19:21,900 --> 00:19:27,990
that's blocking all my hopes

246
00:19:24,780 --> 00:19:27,990
for life ?

247
00:19:29,540 --> 00:19:33,750
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

248
00:19:31,260 --> 00:19:33,750
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

249
00:19:33,820 --> 00:19:37,150
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

250
00:19:37,260 --> 00:19:43,150
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

251
00:19:39,980 --> 00:19:43,150
out of reach.

252
00:19:44,260 --> 00:19:48,630
Immortals

253
00:19:45,300 --> 00:19:48,630
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

254
00:19:48,660 --> 00:19:52,670
Renegades

255
00:19:49,420 --> 00:19:52,670
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

256
00:19:52,420 --> 00:19:56,510
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

257
00:19:54,370 --> 00:19:56,510
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

258
00:19:56,500 --> 00:20:00,630
because I don't see the harm in that.

259
00:20:02,380 --> 00:20:08,430
My new body opens its eyes

260
00:20:04,900 --> 00:20:08,430
and awakens from its dream.

261
00:20:08,300 --> 00:20:15,990
I have overcome many trials

262
00:20:10,420 --> 00:20:15,990
to get this body back.

263
00:20:15,940 --> 00:20:23,630
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

264
00:20:19,980 --> 00:20:23,630
I can still see.

265
00:20:23,780 --> 00:20:32,990
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

266
00:20:27,740 --> 00:20:32,990
